Lichii PR #251 (zortos293/Lichii): keep OoT's movies in time with their sound below 60 FPS.
The game takes one movie frame per game frame; for that title the decoder now follows a real
clock from the first frame and skips frames more than two frame times late (still decoded,
not converted nor handed out). Adapted from Lichii's nx2_gsv decode worker to our synchronous
native_video_decoder PumpOutput. Lichii's EDEN_NX2_MOVIE_CLOCK counters are not ported.

